      <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 mt-10 italic">Codec support changes faster than most areas of video. Apple's AV1 rollout in particular is tied to hardware generations, so device support will keep improving over time. Check current figures against Can I Use and real-device telemetry before making delivery decisions — and note that those two sources often disagree.</p>
